{"Title":"An Act to establish Noah Fernandes mitochondrial disease awareness day","BillNumber":"H4240","DocketNumber":"HD4774","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-03T14:26:59.053"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-03T14:26:59.0533333"},{"Id":"NJO1","Name":"Norman J. Orrall","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NJO1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-01T10:23:10.6466667"},{"Id":"C_H1","Name":"Christopher Hendricks","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_H1","ResponseDate":"2024-02-01T10:23:10.6466667"},{"Id":"MJR0","Name":"Michael J. Rodrigues","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJR0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-01T11:32:44.37"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4240/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cabral of New Bedford, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Antonio F. D. Cabral for the annual issuance by the Governor of a proclamation setting apart the Friday of the third full week of September as Noah Fernandes Mitochondrial Disease awareness day.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 6 of the General Laws, as appearing in the Official 2020 Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after Section 15ZZZZZZ, the following section:  \r\n\tSection XXX. The governor shall annually issue a proclamation setting apart the Friday of the third full week of September as Noah Fernandes Mitochondrial Disease Awareness Day, in recognition of the Team Noah Foundation, whose goal is to alleviate the financial and emotional stress by providing transportation and home improvements to families with children who are affected by Mitochondrial Disease and other developmental disabilities and recommending that the day be observed in an appropriate manner by the people.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4240","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4240/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}